<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-Hans"><head><meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>共道文明 · 文库离线合集 · {{ build.date }}</title>
<style>
body{font:17px/1.8 "Noto Serif SC","Songti SC","SimSun",serif;max-width:46em;margin:2em auto;padding:0 1em;color:#222;background:#faf8f2}
h1{font-size:1.6em}h2{font-size:1.3em;margin-top:2.5em;border-top:1px solid #ccc;padding-top:1em}
.meta{color:#777;font-size:.9em}nav a{display:block}
</style></head><body>
<h1>共道文明 · 文库离线合集</h1>
<p class="meta">生成日期：{{ build.date }} · 共 {{ collections.posts_zh.length }} 篇 · 授权：各篇注明（默认 CC BY-SA 4.0），可自由转载与分发。<br>
